Nowhere to wear them.

00:05:11.849 --> 00:05:12.849
Video games?

00:05:12.849 --> 00:05:16.449
Yeah, like anyone wants to spend more time
watching screens after a long day of Zoom

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:20.030
calls, and also the priority for screens should
